                <pb facs="0203" n="91" xml:id="pg91"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 836/46.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Lorillard to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Lorillard reports that the President of Brazil signed a decree yesterday
                    continuing our 20 per cent preferential tariff until December 31 next.)</p>
            </div>
